Two modules hold data derived from WordNet 3.0:

  src/ontodag/core_ontology.py — the `core` pack, built in the sister repo
  ontodag-core (github.com/petfold/ontodag-core) by consensus over WordNet
  3.0 and other sources; its names and edges draw on WordNet's nouns.
  src/ontodag/core_words.py — other words for core's categories: the
  lemmas of each category's WordNet synset.

